<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1207222573"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:25.147"><div begin="26.104" end="52.573"><p begin="26.104" end="32.871" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.104" end="27.457">你说呢</span> <span begin="28.216" end="29.059">明知</span><span begin="29.059" end="30.164">你不在</span><span begin="30.164" end="31.518">还是会</span><span begin="31.518" end="32.871">问</span></p><p begin="33.105" end="39.703" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.105" end="34.206">空气</span><span begin="34.841" end="36.020">却不能</span><span begin="36.020" end="37.385">代替你</span><span begin="38.046" end="38.364">出</span><span begin="38.364" end="39.703">声</span></p><p begin="39.790" end="46.289" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.790" end="40.678">习惯</span><span begin="41.415" end="43.468">像永不愈合</span><span begin="43.468" end="44.813">的固执伤</span><span begin="44.813" end="46.289">痕</span></p><p begin="46.440" end="52.573" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.440" end="47.668">一思念</span><span begin="47.668" end="49.051">就撕裂</span><span begin="49.051" end="50.050">灵</span><span begin="50.050" end="52.573">魂</span></p></div><div begin="52.710" end="1:18.931"><p begin="52.710" end="59.673" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.710" end="54.080">把相片</span><span begin="54.687" end="56.850">让你能保存</span><span begin="56.850" end="57.932">多洗一</span><span begin="57.932" end="59.673">本</span></p><p begin="59.844" end="1:06.479" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.844" end="1:00.753">毛衣</span><span begin="1:01.490" end="1:02.702">也为你</span><span begin="1:02.702" end="1:03.504">准备</span><span begin="1:03.504" end="1:04.267">多</span><span begin="1:04.860" end="1:05.206">一</span><span begin="1:05.206" end="1:06.479">层</span></p><p begin="1:06.479" end="1:13.079" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.479" end="1:07.187">但是</span><span begin="1:08.086" end="1:10.067">你孤单时刻</span><span begin="1:10.067" end="1:11.255">安慰的</span><span begin="1:11.255" end="1:11.634">体</span><span begin="1:11.634" end="1:13.079">温</span></p><p begin="1:13.079" end="1:18.931" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.079" end="1:13.917">怎么</span><span begin="1:13.917" end="1:14.797">为你</span><span begin="1:14.797" end="1:15.759">多留</span><span begin="1:15.759" end="1:16.997">一</span><span begin="1:16.997" end="1:18.931">份</span></p></div><div begin="1:18.931" end="1:46.086"><p begin="1:18.931" end="1:22.454" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.931" end="1:20.117">我不愿</span><span begin="1:20.117" end="1:20.985">让你</span><span begin="1:20.985" end="1:21.781">一个</span><span begin="1:21.781" end="1:22.454">人</span></p><p begin="1:22.454" end="1:25.807" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.454" end="1:23.361">一个人</span><span begin="1:23.361" end="1:23.889">在</span><span begin="1:23.889" end="1:24.750">人海</span><span begin="1:24.750" end="1:25.004">浮</span><span begin="1:25.004" end="1:25.807">沉</span></p><p begin="1:25.807" end="1:32.309" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.807" end="1:26.794">我不愿</span><span begin="1:26.794" end="1:27.356">你</span><span begin="1:27.356" end="1:29.058">独自走过</span><span begin="1:29.315" end="1:30.786">风雨的</span><span begin="1:31.311" end="1:31.545">时</span><span begin="1:31.545" end="1:32.309">分</span></p><p begin="1:32.309" end="1:35.750" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.309" end="1:33.495">我不愿</span><span begin="1:33.495" end="1:34.363">让你</span><span begin="1:34.363" end="1:35.159">一个</span><span begin="1:35.159" end="1:35.750">人</span></p><p begin="1:35.750" end="1:39.183" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.750" end="1:36.708">承受这</span><span begin="1:36.708" end="1:38.063">世界的</span><span begin="1:38.063" end="1:38.325">残</span><span begin="1:38.325" end="1:39.183">忍</span></p><p begin="1:39.183" end="1:46.086" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.183" end="1:40.050">我不愿</span><span begin="1:40.050" end="1:41.150">眼泪</span><span begin="1:41.150" end="1:42.420">陪你到</span><span begin="1:42.689" end="1:43.393">永</span><span begin="1:43.393" end="1:46.086">恒</span></p></div><div begin="1:46.086" end="2:13.233"><p begin="1:46.086" end="1:53.006" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.086" end="1:47.470">你走后</span> <span begin="1:48.096" end="1:50.133">爱情的遗迹</span><span begin="1:50.133" end="1:51.026">像是</span><span begin="1:51.026" end="1:51.622">空</span><span begin="1:51.622" end="1:53.006">城</span></p><p begin="1:53.124" end="1:59.736" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.124" end="1:54.226">遗落</span><span begin="1:54.900" end="1:55.915">你杯子</span><span begin="1:55.915" end="1:56.740">手套</span><span begin="1:56.740" end="1:58.054">和</span><span begin="1:58.054" end="1:58.407">笑</span><span begin="1:58.407" end="1:59.736">声</span></p><p begin="1:59.736" end="2:06.390" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.736" end="2:00.793">最后</span> <span begin="2:01.326" end="2:03.076">你只带走</span><span begin="2:03.076" end="2:04.794">你脆弱和</span><span begin="2:04.794" end="2:05.200">单</span><span begin="2:05.200" end="2:06.390">纯</span></p><p begin="2:06.421" end="2:13.233" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.421" end="2:07.270">和我</span><span begin="2:07.270" end="2:09.133">最放不下</span><span begin="2:09.133" end="2:10.216">的</span><span begin="2:10.216" end="2:13.233">人</span></p></div><div begin="2:25.087" end="2:39.031"><p begin="2:25.087" end="2:28.552" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.087" end="2:25.780">也许</span><span begin="2:25.780" end="2:26.473">未来</span> <span begin="2:26.850" end="2:27.553">你会</span><span begin="2:27.553" end="2:27.859">找</span><span begin="2:27.859" end="2:28.552">到</span></p><p begin="2:28.552" end="2:33.095" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.552" end="2:29.310">懂你</span><span begin="2:29.310" end="2:29.984">疼你</span> <span begin="2:30.197" end="2:31.068">更好</span><span begin="2:31.068" end="2:31.544">的</span><span begin="2:31.544" end="2:33.095">人</span></p><p begin="2:33.429" end="2:35.231" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.429" end="2:34.213">下段</span><span begin="2:34.213" end="2:34.630">旅</span><span begin="2:34.630" end="2:35.231">程</span></p><p begin="2:35.231" end="2:39.031" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.231" end="2:35.673">你</span><span begin="2:35.673" end="2:36.692">一定要</span><span begin="2:36.920" end="2:37.922">更幸福</span><span begin="2:37.922" end="2:38.271">丰</span><span begin="2:38.271" end="2:39.031">盛</span></p></div><div begin="2:39.031" end="3:09.307"><p begin="2:39.031" end="2:42.453" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.031" end="2:40.217">我不愿</span><span begin="2:40.217" end="2:41.085">让你</span><span begin="2:41.085" end="2:41.881">一个</span><span begin="2:41.881" end="2:42.453">人</span></p><p begin="2:42.453" end="2:45.806" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.453" end="2:43.360">一个人</span><span begin="2:43.360" end="2:43.888">在</span><span begin="2:43.888" end="2:44.749">人海</span><span begin="2:44.749" end="2:45.003">浮</span><span begin="2:45.003" end="2:45.806">沉</span></p><p begin="2:45.849" end="2:52.252" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.849" end="2:46.836">我不愿</span><span begin="2:46.836" end="2:47.398">你</span><span begin="2:47.398" end="2:49.100">独自走过</span><span begin="2:49.357" end="2:50.828">风雨的</span><span begin="2:51.353" end="2:51.587">时</span><span begin="2:51.587" end="2:52.252">分</span></p><p begin="2:52.252" end="2:55.765" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.252" end="2:53.438">我不愿</span><span begin="2:53.438" end="2:54.306">让你</span><span begin="2:54.306" end="2:55.102">一个</span><span begin="2:55.102" end="2:55.765">人</span></p><p begin="2:55.765" end="2:59.198" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.765" end="2:56.723">承受这</span><span begin="2:56.723" end="2:58.078">